72
00:05:23,201 --> 00:05:27,200
a liquid, in which molecules bounce around randomly, glass

73
00:05:27,201 --> 00:05:31,200
molecules neither bounce around nor line up.

74
00:05:31,201 --> 00:05:34,700
This is called a viscous pattern.

75
00:05:34,701 --> 00:05:38,200
Glass is really the condition of any matter that has immobile

76
00:05:38,201 --> 00:05:41,700
